            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruk 14:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakurua akabhërëkëra umuiraniö gonsui hamui na abhëëga bhaae, akabhateebhia iga, “Örë wonsui agutuna köbha umuëga waane kuhika aisase tanga, aimuki ömösarabha gooe, andue nyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.10.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 10:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ruk 17:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira örë wonsui agutuna gutuuria öbhöhoru bhooe, kuhika abhötabhute; sibhoono, örë wonsui aratabhute öbhöhoru bhooe gikugira yaane hamui na igichiiratë keene, narabhutuuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira, mbuëra kë ömöntö aranyoore gukuibhamba ëkëbhara këno gionsui, si atabhute öbhöhoru bhooe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gösë nkë ömöntö akaruusia kuibhaga riö öbhöhoru bhooe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 8:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira örë wonsui aramaahëre ichinsoni hamui na amaigiö gaane guiköra irinyanku rëno rëtatöndörëëyöë na Ënooköë, Ömoona wö Ömöntö nawe naarëmömaahëra ichinsoni hano ariicha kubhuhiku bho isawaabho hamui na abhamaraika abhahoreeru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.8.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.8.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
